**What was produced**: An exact analytic theorem replacing S148's empirical "K ≈ 3.86" formula:

  E(p, N) = 2 (π(N) − O(1))² / ((p−1) N) + O(p · Var(p, N) / N)

for the L² energy of chi_P in V_p^prim ⊕ V_{2p}^prim, where the main term is a **Ramanujan-sum / principal-Dirichlet-character quantity** (c_p(k) = μ(p) = −1, c_{2p}(k) = μ(2p) = +1), NOT a Gallagher variance as S148 had framed. The Gallagher variance enters only in the sub-leading remainder.

